{{!-- Rendered only when an Attack roll's hit produced at least one nonzero
      damage-type subtotal (see module/dice/dice.mjs's CarlDice.rollAttack
      and module/chat/damage-card.mjs). Pills show the RAW rolled subtotal
      per type - DR/Resistance/Vulnerability/Immunity are only computed when
      Apply Damage is actually clicked, against the target's live state, so
      no reduced number is shown here ahead of time. The button's click
      handler and GM/owner visibility gating are wired up client-side by
      the shared registerChatListener (module/chat/chat-listener.mjs), via
      this button's data-action and damage-card.mjs's damageActionEntries -
      not baked into this markup. --}}
<div class="carl-damage-card">
  <div class="carl-damage-portions">
    <span class="carl-damage-label">{{localize "CARLRPG.Damage.WillApply"}}</span>
    {{#each portions}}
    <span class="carl-damage-pill">{{this.amount}} {{this.label}}</span>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
  <button type="button" class="carl-apply-damage" data-action="applyDamage">
    <i class="fas fa-heart-crack"></i> {{localize "CARLRPG.Damage.ApplyButton"}}
  </button>
</div>
